          "Create a key with `age-keygen -o <key file>` and print its public key with `age-keygen -y <key file>`.",
          "Encrypt with one `-r` per recipient: `age -o <file>.age -r \"$(age-keygen -y <key file>)\" -r \"$(age-keygen -y <other key file>)\" <file>`.",
          "Any recipient can decrypt with `age -d -i <key file> <file>.age`."
        ]
      },
      {
        "feature": "generate hybrid post-quantum keys",
